# PRIVATE vault content — NEVER commit (this repo is PUBLIC). Per-user vault mirrors
# (SKUEL_USER_VAULTS_ROOT defaults to data/user_vaults) and the ADR-075 local-agent
# staging mirror hold personal/proprietary content. The repo-root .gitignore already
# blanket-ignores app/data/; these are called out explicitly for local visibility, and
# scripts/audit_content_boundary.py enforces that no content/vault path is ever tracked
# (also a unit test → CI gate), which catches force-adds and content pasted elsewhere.
data/user_vaults/
data/staging/

