scratch*.py
firefly startup command

# Extensionless conversation notes under docs/roadmap/. Committed by mistake in
# #1209 (untracked again by #1210) and swept in three more times by directory-level
# `git add` while building the `updated:` auto-stamp — the same accident four times
# is what earns a rule. `docs/roadmap/` holds tracked `.md` roadmap docs; a note
# without an extension is working scratch. Add new ones here rather than committing
# one (the `counts_*.json` convention above).
docs/roadmap/Askesis Tool Selection - planned
docs/roadmap/next from aug 31

# Graph census exports (scripts/export_entity_counts.py). Point-in-time node /
# relationship counts of a LIVE graph, written to the repo root by the migration
# guides (AURADB_MIGRATION_GUIDE "> before.json", DO_MIGRATION_GUIDE
# "> counts_$(date +%Y%m%d).json"), consumed by --compare, then disposable.
# Never tracked: this repo is PUBLIC and a census publishes the shape and scale
# of personal data. Regenerate on demand instead. Other census filenames vary —
# add them here rather than committing one.
before.json
counts_*.json

# Implementation plans (local working notes, not source)
plans/

# k8s live secrets — never commit; see k8s-secrets.yml.example
k8s-secrets.yml
